    "created_at": "2020-03-25T15:27:05Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-03-25T15:27:05Z",
    "body": "@annevk Sorry, by \"uses\" I meant that nothing creates such requests. CSP switches on request having an initiator of `prefetch`, but since nothing creates such request that part of the specification is effectively dead. (That's actually how this came up; I was trying to figure out what that part of the CSP spec did.)",
